# Build-time setting for the production web portal. Vite only reads files named .env.production, so this
# example changes nothing until it is copied. Nothing secret belongs here: the value is compiled into the
# public JavaScript. Set it for the build that is deployed; without it the portal calls "/smartflow-api",
# which exists only behind the Vite development proxy.
#
# Same-origin layout from docs/product/PRODUCTION-DEPLOYMENT.md: portal at https://HOST/, API at https://HOST/api
VITE_API_BASE=/api
